From 8da8313a25b94c2818ac9b02a4978079ee4d3709 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Feb 2026 10:08:49 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 445/572] fix(st-pmic): initialize some structs in
 dt_pmic2_i2c_config

Initialize i2c_info & i2c_init structs with zeros to avoid random values
from the stack.
This corrects MISRA_C_2012_Rule_9.1: The value of an object with
automatic storage duration shall not be read before it has been set.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git a2a237b6cb2808d43e0b403a53432ed6d94071b5 fix(st-pmic): initialize some structs in dt_pmic2_i2c_config]
Change-Id: I6f9caac4ef23287ff875b9f375b93c6ba3281288
Signed-off-by: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/541288
Reviewed-by: Maxime MERE <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Patrick DELAUNAY <patrick.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
---
 drivers/st/pmic/stm32mp_pmic2.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/st/pmic/stm32mp_pmic2.c b/drivers/st/pmic/stm32mp_pmic2.c
index 94a45045ee..977f67e436 100644
--- a/drivers/st/pmic/stm32mp_pmic2.c
+++ b/drivers/st/pmic/stm32mp_pmic2.c
@@ -132,10 +132,10 @@ bool initialize_pmic_i2c(void)
 {
 	int ret;
 	uint8_t val;
-	struct dt_node_info i2c_info;
+	struct dt_node_info i2c_info = { 0 };
 	struct i2c_handle_s *i2c = &i2c_handle;
 	uint32_t i2c_addr = 0U;
-	struct stm32_i2c_init_s i2c_init;
+	struct stm32_i2c_init_s i2c_init = { 0 };
 
 	ret = dt_pmic2_i2c_config(&i2c_info, &i2c_init, &i2c_addr);
 	if (ret < 0) {
-- 
